            </aside>
            <div class="wz-wmain">
            <h4><span class="wz-hico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><rect x="8" y="2" width="8" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="M9 13l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>Your details <small>so our team can confirm the booking</small></h4>
            <div class="wz-f">
              <div class="wz-fl wz-afl"><span>Your area</span>
                <span class="wz-ic wz-area"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg><input data-wz-area autocomplete="off" placeholder="Type your area, e.g. Qurum" aria-label="Your area" role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-controls="wz-asug" maxlength="80" />
                  <button type="button" class="wz-loc" data-wz-loc><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7"/></svg><span>Use my location</span></button>
                  <ul class="wz-asug" id="wz-asug" role="listbox" data-wz-asug hidden></ul>
                </span>
                <p class="wz-astat" data-wz-astat hidden></p>
